        "source": "NUMERICAL CHARACTERISTICS: \"Test coverage: `wcs = WCS(naxis=2)`; set `wcs.wcs.ctype = [\\\"RA---TAN\\\", \\\"DEC--TAN\\\"]`; `wcs.wcs.set()`; assert `wcs.world_axis_object_components is wcs.world_axis_object_components`\""
